#: kiconedit.cpp:253
#, kde-format
msgid "New &Window"
msgstr "Nieg &Finster"

#: kiconedit.cpp:256
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"New window\n"
"\n"
"Opens a new icon editor window."
msgstr ""
"Nieg Finster\n"
"\n"
"Maakt en nieg Finster vun den Lüttbildeditor op."

#: kiconedit.cpp:259
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"New\n"
"\n"
"Create a new icon, either from a template or by specifying the size"
msgstr ""
"Nieg\n"
"\n"
"En nieg Lüttbild opstellen, vun en Vörlaag oder dör Fastleggen vun de Grött"

#: kiconedit.cpp:263
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Open\n"
"\n"
"Open an existing icon"
msgstr ""
"Opmaken\n"
"\n"
"En vörhannen Lüttbild opmaken"

#: kiconedit.cpp:271
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Save\n"
"\n"
"Save the current icon"
msgstr ""
"Sekern\n"
"\n"
"Aktuell Lüttbild sekern"

#: kiconedit.cpp:276
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Print\n"
"\n"
"Opens a print dialog to let you print the current icon."
msgstr ""
"Drucken\n"
"\n"
"Maakt en Druckdialoog op, so dat Du dat aktuelle Lüttbild utdrucken kannst."

#: kiconedit.cpp:284
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Cut\n"
"\n"
"Cut the current selection out of the icon.\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: You can make both rectangular and circular selections)"
msgstr ""
"Knippen\n"
"\n"
"Aktuell Köör ut dat Lüttbild knippen.\n"
"\n"
"(Tipp: De Köör kann rechteckig oder rund wesen)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:288
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Copy\n"
"\n"
"Copy the current selection out of the icon.\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: You can make both rectangular and circular selections)"
msgstr ""
"Koperen\n"
"\n"
"Aktuell Köör ut dat Lüttbild koperen\n"
"\n"
"(Tipp: De Köör kann rechteckig oder rund wesen)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:292
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Paste\n"
"\n"
"Paste the contents of the clipboard into the current icon.\n"
"\n"
"If the contents are larger than the current icon you can paste them in a new "
"window.\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: Select \"Paste transparent pixels\" in the configuration dialog if you "
"also want to paste transparency.)"
msgstr ""
"Infögen\n"
"\n"
"Föögt de Twischenaflaag ehr Inholt na't aktuelle Lüttbild in.\n"
"\n"
"Wenn de Inholt grötter is as dat aktuell Lüttbild, kannst Du em na en nieg "
"Finster infögen.\n"
"\n"
"(Tipp: Söök \"Dörsichtig Pixels infögen\" binnen den Instellen-Dialoog ut, "
"wenn Du ok Transparenz infögen wullt.)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:300
#, kde-format
msgid "Paste as &New"
msgstr "As &nieg infögen"

#: kiconedit.cpp:309
#, kde-format
msgid "Resi&ze..."
msgstr "&Grött ännern..."

#: kiconedit.cpp:312
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Resize\n"
"\n"
"Smoothly resizes the icon while trying to preserve the contents"
msgstr ""
"Grött ännern\n"
"\n"
"Verännert suutje de Grött vun dat Lüttbild, un versöcht den Inholt to wohren"

#: kiconedit.cpp:317
#, kde-format
msgid "&GrayScale"
msgstr "&Griestöön"

#: kiconedit.cpp:320
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Gray scale\n"
"\n"
"Gray scale the current icon.\n"
"(Warning: The result is likely to contain colors not in the icon palette"
msgstr ""
"Griestöön\n"
"\n"
"Stellt dat aktuell Lüttbild in Griestöön dor.\n"
"(Wohrschoen: Dat Resultaat bargt wohrschienlich Klören buten den Lüttbild-"
"Klörensett)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:327
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Zoom in\n"
"\n"
"Zoom in by one."
msgstr ""
"Grötter\n"
"\n"
"Maakt de Ansicht een Stoop grötter."

#: kiconedit.cpp:331
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Zoom out\n"
"\n"
"Zoom out by one."
msgstr ""
"Lütter\n"
"\n"
"Maakt de Ansicht een Stoop lütter."

#: kiconedit.cpp:335
#, kde-format
msgid "&Zoom"
msgstr "Ansicht&grött"

